OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 17 Oct to Mon 26 Oct
OL,6,FHigh pressure is expected to lie close
OL,7,Fto or across the UK through much of
OL,8,Fthis period. This will mean largely
OL,9,Ffine and dry weather for many, perhaps
OL,10,Fwith some overnight mist and fog
OL,11,Fpatches. Weak frontal systems could
OL,12,Fbring some rain at times and if this
OL,13,Fhappens it is most likely in the far
OL,14,Fsouth or perhaps far north of the UK.
OL,15,FWinds are expected to be mostly light.
OL,16,FTemperatures will likely be around
OL,17,Fnormal for the time of year, with
OL,18,Ffrosty mornings in the usual prone
OL,19,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
