OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tue 27 Oct to Tue 10 Nov
OL,6,FHigh pressure will probably be
OL,7,Fdominant at first with many areas fine
OL,8,Fand dry. A transition to more
OL,9,Fchangeable or unsettled weather
OL,10,Fpatterns is expected by the start of
OL,11,FNovember with showers or longer spells
OL,12,Fof rain becoming more likely.
OL,13,FTemperatures are likely to be near or
OL,14,Fa little above normal for the period
OL,15,Fas a whole.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
